{"ts":"2026-07-06T08:03:04.731Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/441\n\n## Problem\n`pm create --help --type Task` prints a \"Type-aware option policies\" block listing 19 flags as \"required\", but a 3-flag create succeeds in default mode. The list is actually type-APPLICABLE flags and ignores the active --create-mode. Agents over-provision creates or judge create unusable.\n\n## Proposed fix\nHelp must reflect the real policy: genuinely mandatory fields for the ACTIVE create-mode (default -> --title/--type), with the full set labeled \"applicable\" (or \"required in strict mode\"). Strict mode shows the strict set.\n\n## Definition of done\nType-aware help output matches runtime enforcement per create-mode; spec covers default vs strict rendering; contracts/help snapshots updated."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-qmjx"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-441: type-aware create help mislabels applicable flags as required (ignores create-mode)"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Dogfood GH-441: create help lists 19 type-applicable flags as 'required' though a 3-flag create succeeds; help must reflect the active create-mode policy. Duplicate check: searched create help required/type-aware policy — no existing item."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:cli","bug","gh-issue"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-06T08:03:04.731Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T08:03:04.731Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":90},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"pm create --help --type T shows genuinely mandatory fields for the active create-mode with applicable fields labeled separately; spec covers default vs strict rendering"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-mpbb"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"291d9ef9395fc1b48a3f374148e8c04630a29ac4e38b2ee66f9895831ab14e2e","message":""}
